pe</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The last component of an exception postcondition stack. It reduces to `Unit`, so every\n`Unit` instance applies. It is a named constant, so only a stack prints as `EStack⟨…⟩`. ","docLink":"./Std/WP/EStack.html#Std.WP.EStackEnd","kind":"def","line":30,"name":"Std.WP.EStackEnd","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Std/WP/EStack.lean#L30-L32"}}],"imports":["Std.WP.Assertion"],"instances":[],"name":"Std.WP.EStack"}